    <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
      <name>PageClearing</name>
      <id>23</id>
      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>DecorationClearingExplanation</name>
        <id>32</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Cleaning up unused space.
The storage will be cleared of records that were deleted before the specified date.
We recommend setting the cleanup date earlier than the date when the last database backup was created, provided that a later backup of the binary data storage exists.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>پاک‌سازی فضای استفاده‌نشده.
رکوردهایی که پیش از تاریخ مشخص‌شده حذف شده‌اند از ذخیره‌ساز پاک خواهند شد.
توصیه می‌کنیم تاریخ پاک‌سازی را زودتر از تاریخ ایجاد آخرین پشتیبان پایگاه داده تنظیم کنید، مشروط بر اینکه پشتیبان جدیدتری از ذخیره‌ساز داده‌های باینری وجود داشته باشد.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Очистка неиспользуемого места.
Хранилище будет очищено от записей, которые были удалены до указанной даты.
Рекомендуется установить дату очистки до даты создания последней резервной копии базы данных при условии, что есть более поздняя резервная копия хранилища двоичных данных.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Kullanılmayan alanın temizlenmesi.
Depo, belirtilen tarihten önce silinen kayıtlardan temizlenecektir.
İkili veri deposunun daha yeni bir yedek kopyası olması şartıyla, temizleme tarihinin veri tabanının son yedek kopyasının oluşturulma tarihinden öncesine ayarlanması tavsiye edilir.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Cleaning up unused space.
The storage will be cleared of records that were deleted before the specified date.
We recommend setting the cleanup date earlier than the date when the last database backup was created, provided that a later backup of the binary data storage exists.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Cleaning up unused space.
The storage will be cleared of records that were deleted before the specified date.
We recommend setting the cleanup date earlier than the date when the last database backup was created, provided that a later backup of the binary data storage exists.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Cleaning up unused space.
The storage will be cleared of records that were deleted before the specified date.
We recommend setting the cleanup date earlier than the date when the last database backup was created, provided that a later backup of the binary data storage exists.</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>DecorationClearingExplanationExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>34</id>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
        <contextMenu>
          <name>DecorationClearingExplanationContextMenu</name>
          <id>33</id>
          <autoFill>true</autoFill>
        </contextMenu>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </items>
      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>LastClearingDate</name>
        <id>35</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Last cleanup date</value>
        </title>
